00:02:25.700 --> 00:02:26.640
Then we run it.

00:02:26.640 --> 00:02:27.520
Capable as

00:02:27.600 --> 00:02:29.220
we all are, not 
all of us can

00:02:29.220 --> 00:02:29.680
make it through that!

00:02:29.780 --> 00:02:30.300
Not 
all of us have to.

00:02:31.600 --> 00:02:34.160
Yes, I like it.

00:02:38.720 --> 00:02:41.280
Thank you 
for getting it this far

